      "body": "Alternative possible version: the first version mirrors the Authors logic (full regex + email storage in %emails) for consistency. However, since Deputies are already in %EmailField, the check already validates the Name <email> format, so we could optionally only extract the name and append it.\n\n```diff\n+\t\t} elsif ($field eq 'Deputies') {\n+\t\t\t$val =~ m/^(\\S[^<@>]*\\S) </ or die \"Malformed Deputies line in $fn\";\n+\t\t\tmy $deputyname = $1;\n+\t\t\tif (defined $authors) {\n+\t\t\t\t$authors .= \", $deputyname\";\n+\t\t\t} else {\n+\t\t\t\t$authors = $deputyname;\n+\t\t\t}\n```",
